  "scope": "Wire original updateAgent into additive five-function sealed Normal/Audit ownership profile with fixed13-argument wrapper. Preserve manage_workflows Browser/PAT purpose and FreshAuthfalse, canonical14 CAS/idempotent receipts/audit/posture/summary behavior. Outer80 fence holds79 and target locks; wrapper takes exact canonical advisory and active-entity locks, rechecks current authority after waits before canonical mutation/replay. Postwrite identity/context/catalog checks preserve legitimate finding-created79desired changes without revalidating the obsolete prewrite revision. Bind nine actual parent frames including security_ready. Explicit runtime/startup/periodic readiness, bounded migration confirmation and API-only default-off deployment. No new parent grants or legacy SQL admission.",
